hildren could avail these facilities.','','PRAD/MA','Kolkata','Chanakya National Law University, Mithapur, Patna','Rubina Haque','Law','VE East Region ','','1,5',NULL,3,'2025-06-25',NULL,0,'2025-06-25',4,0,'','2025-06-19',''),(70,151,'','3','While documenting the case stories, we received a lot of information from the sir and madam but if we could have spoken with the children whose stories we documented, or with their family members, it  might have been even more helpful. That said , we did receive all kinds of information from the sir and madam.','','VE','Kolkata','152, New No. 8, 2nd St, Gitanjali Park, Kalikapur, Haltu, Kolkata, West Bengal 700099','Rubina Haque','Language','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-06-21',''),(71,676,'','4','As part of our Media Relations internship, we studied the media depiction of children with a focus on education, health, and nutrition. We reviewed articles from December 2024 to April 2025, compiled them into an Excel sheet, and categorized them thematically. From the sorted data, we developed an analysis report identifying trends, gaps, and the framing of children’s issues in the media.','','others','delhi','Symbiosis centre for media and communication, Pune','Abhik Bhattacharya','Mass media/journalism','VE North Region ','','1,9',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-06-21',''),(72,678,'','4','This group research project is a deep dive into how Indian media talks about children but rarely \'with\' them. This report looks at what’s missing, what’s working, and how we can tell children’s stories better.\r\n\r\n','','others','delhi','Symbiosis Centre for Media and Communication, Pune','Abhik Buthattacharya','Mass media/journalism','VE North Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-06-21',''),(73,463,'','4','This report explores the depiction of children in Indian media. ','','others','delhi','Symbiosis Centre for media and communication, Pune','Abhik Bhattacharya','Mass media/journalism','VE North Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-06-21',''),(74,433,'','4','Our project critically examined how Indian mainstream media portrays children across education, health, and protection themes by analyzing 50–100 articles from diverse national and regional outlets over six months. We identified framing patterns, voice representation, and solution-focused reporting gaps to inform child rights advocacy and ethical journalism practices.','','others','delhi','Symbiosis Centre for Media & Communications, Pune','Abhik Bhattacharya','Mass media/journalism','VE North Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-06-21',''),(75,436,'','4','It was nice working with Cry, however few things could have been made the process lot quicker and efficient. For instance, The cordinator\'s engagement was a bit low if it could have been more involved and engaging it would have uplifted the whole process. Otherwise it was good working with Cry ','','others','delhi','SCMC, Pune ','Abhik Bhattacharya ','Mass media/journalism','VE North Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-06-21',''),(76,504,'','3','The project was about child rights and their right to education. Child rights are the human rights specifically meant for children to ensure their well-being, development, protection, and participation in society. These rights recognize the special needs children due to their vulnerability and dependence. The convention is built on our key principles: the right to survival, development, protection, and participation. ','','others','Kolkata','Loreto College ','Rubina Haque ','Humanities','VE East Region ','','5,6',NULL,3,'2025-06-25',NULL,0,'2025-06-25',4,0,'','2025-06-21',''),(77,464,'','4','The project procedure was great, memorable and insightful. My internship started on 15th May and ended on 21st June. It was my first time working for an NGO, that too a well-established one like Child Rights and You (CRY). Anytime, a group work requires discipline, coordination and camaraderie. I am fortunate as I could get an opportunity to work for this NGO and deliver something fruitful. ','','others','delhi','Symbiosis Centre for Media and Communication, Pune','Dr. Abhik Bhattacharya','Mass media/journalism','VE North Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-06-21',''),(78,197,'','3','The project could be improved with the face to face interview. ','','VE','Kolkata','Lady brabourne college ','Rubina Haque','others','VE East Region ','','2',NULL,2,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-06-23',''),(79,659,'','3','Worked on video production for a documentary on child labour, handling scripting, filming, and editing to raise awareness. Also contributed to a feature reel showcasing a day in the life of CRY interns, capturing behind-the-scenes experiences and promoting engagement. Gained hands-on experience in impactful storytelling, visual communication, and ethical content creation.','','others','Kolkata','Symbiosis Centre for Media and Communication, Pune','Rubina Haque','Mass media/journalism','VE East Region ','','4,8',NULL,3,'2025-06-25',NULL,0,'2025-06-25',4,0,'','2025-06-24',''),(80,1082,'','3','Research and Documentation ','','VE','Online','St. Xavier\'s College (Autonomous), Kolkata ','Rubina Haque ','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-06-25',NULL,0,'2025-06-25',4,0,'','2025-06-24',''),(81,662,'','3','More fieldwork','','VE','Kolkata','152, Kalikapur, Gitanjali Park, New No. 8, 2nd Street, Kolkata, West Bengal 700099','Rubina Haque','Mass media/journalism','VE East Region ','','4',NULL,3,'2025-06-25',NULL,0,'2025-06-25',4,0,'','2025-06-24',''),(82,662,'',NULL,'Contributed to a documentary on child labour and a behind-the-scenes intern feature reel, focusing on storytelling, research, and awareness-building.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-06-25',NULL,0,'202