'If we could go to the field and communicate directly with the guardians, we could have organized this work more effectively.','','VE','Kolkata','CRY   152, New No. 8, 2nd St, Gitanjali Park, Kalikapur, Haltu, Kolkata, West Bengal 700099','Rubina Haque','Language','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-06-25',''),(101,156,'','3','Case story writing can be improved by following methods:\r\n1) start with human connection \r\n2) Focusing on the journey \r\n3) Including emotions and quotes \r\n4) keeping it ethical and respectful \r\n5) using simple clear language.','','VE','Kolkata','CRY   152, New No. 8, 2nd St, Gitanjali Park, Kalikapur, Haltu, Kolkata, West Bengal 700099','Rubina Haque','Language','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-06-26',''),(102,71,'','2','Interacted with children in child activity Centre, taught them, played with them and made them do activities. Also went to community visit where I interacted and talked to the parents of children to collect their basic details and information. Also went to Rajghat with children for picnic and some enjoyment. Overall, it was a good and worthy experience especially in the field of social work. ','','DS','delhi','Chanakya National Law University, Patna, Bihar','Jeetendra Sir','Law','VE East Region ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-06-26',''),(103,747,'','3','The CRY (Child Rights and You) initiative in Raja Bazar is a community-based educational program aimed at supporting underprivileged children through free weekly sessions. These sessions focus on core academic subjects such as English, Mathematics, General Knowledge, and Social Science, while also incorporating creative activities like drawing, painting, and crafts. The program encourages holistic development by improving communication skills, boosting self-confidence, and promoting social aware','','VE','Kolkata','Lady Brabourne College, P-1/2, Suhrawardy Ave, Beniapukur, Kolkata, West Bengal 700017','Rubina Haque ','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-06-27',''),(104,747,'',NULL,'The Child Safeguarding Policy by CRY (Child Rights and You) is a comprehensive framework designed to protect children from abuse, neglect, and exploitation. It outlines clear definitions, guiding principles, a code of conduct, and detailed procedures for prevention, reporting, and response. The policy ensures that all CRY staff, associates, visitors, and volunteers are educated on safeguarding standards. It integrates statutory compliance, media regulations, child participation norms, and event ','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-06-27',''),(105,747,'',NULL,'The Child Safeguarding Policy by CRY (Child Rights and You) is a comprehensive framework designed to protect children from abuse, neglect, and exploitation. It outlines clear definitions, guiding principles, a code of conduct, and detailed procedures for prevention, reporting, and response. The policy ensures that all CRY staff, associates, visitors, and volunteers are educated on safeguarding standards. It integrates statutory compliance, media regulations, child participation norms, and event.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-06-27',''),(106,742,'','3','The project can be improved by collecting more firsthand quotes from children and volunteers to make the story more vivid and personal. Including specific challenges faced and how CRY helped overcome them would add depth. Feedback from field workers can also help refine the narrative for future documentation.\r\nThe PPT can be improved by using more real-life visuals and case examples to highlight the impact of CSP. Including statistical comparisons, feedback from beneficiaries, and simplified key ','','VE','Kolkata','Lady Brabourne College, P-1/2, Suhrawardy Ave, Beniapukur, Kolkata, West Bengal 700017','Rubina Haque','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-06-27',''),(107,173,'',NULL,'It is good to handle when it is face to face interaction with child. ','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-06-29',''),(108,1646,'','3','This file is regarding my internship ','','VE','Kolkata','Adamas University ','Rubina Haque ','Law','VE West ','','11',NULL,2,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-06-29',''),(109,1640,'','3','Name: Sourav Sharma\r\nInternship Period: 2nd June 2025 – 30th June 2025\r\nOrganization: CRY ( Child Rights and You )\r\nPosition: Legal Intern\r\n\r\n1. Introduction\r\nThis report provides an overview of the internship I undertook from 2nd June 2025 to 30th June 2025, during which I worked as a Research Intern focused on issues related to child rights. The internship gave me valuable insights into the functioning of a non-governmental organization (NGO) and enhanced both my academic and practical understanding','','others','Kolkata','Adamas University ','Rubina Haque','Law','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-06-30',''),(110,1756,'','1,10','Summary of insights gained and tasks completed','','Finance','delhi','NA','Mohit Dhingra','others','VE North Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-10',NULL,0,'2025-07-10',4,0,'','2025-06-30',''),(111,1756,'',NULL,'Summary of insights gained and tasks completed','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-10',NULL,0,'2025-07-10',4,0,'','2025-06-30',''),(112,1652,'','3','This project, \"The Law That Listens: POSCO & Your Right to Safety,\" was designed to educate children about personal safety, their rights under the law, and the critical protections offered by the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences (POCSO) Act, 2012. The initiative aimed to empower children to recognize, resist, and report unsafe situations, and 