,'delhi','Dr B.R. Ambedkar University, Delhi ','Smriti Rustagi ','others','VE North Region ','','1,2',NULL,3,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-06-30',''),(121,1642,'','','Me and my team made a document on the topic of CHILD SEXUAL HARRASMENT to conduct sessions in the future.','','VE','Kolkata','Adamas University.  Barasat, Kolkata ','Rubina Haque','Law','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,1,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,'0000-00-00',0,0,'','2025-06-30',''),(122,1640,'',NULL,'We have made project under children sexual abuse and child right safeguard policy. Through this we get knowledge about how in your works and what are the safety measures should we take to protect children\'s who are not in normal situation. Through this we know about how child rights works and what are the benefits given by the children.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-06-30',''),(123,1638,'','','Me and my team made a document on the topic of CHILD SEXUAL HARRASMENT to conduct sessions in the future.','','VE','Kolkata','Adamas University, Barasat, Kolkata','Rubina Haque','Law','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,1,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,'0000-00-00',0,0,'','2025-06-30',''),(124,1624,'','10','Supported CRY’s Volunteer Engagement and Finance Departments by creating child rights awareness materials and verifying financial documents. Developed a legal awareness presentation, compiled outreach data, and organized vouchers for audit compliance. Applied social work principles like accountability and integrity while enhancing skills in documentation, communication, and administrative systems.','','Finance','Kolkata','Adamas University, Adamas Knowledge City, Barasat - Barrackpore Road, Jagannathpur, Kolkata, West Bengal 700126','Rubina Haque','Law','VE East Region ','','1,9',NULL,3,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-07-01',''),(125,1298,'','2','As part of my internship with CRY and Nav Srishti NGO, I taught children (6–14) core subjects using interactive methods. I also supported community programs like health camps, legal and mental health sessions, and digital literacy workshops, focusing on child rights, inclusive education, and empowerment of underserved groups.','','DS','delhi','IILM University, Greater Noida','Smiriti Rustagi','others','VE North Region ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-07-01',''),(126,1646,'',NULL,'Project Description – CRY (Child Rights and You) Internship\r\n\r\nProject Title: Promoting Child Rights through Community Awareness and Advocacy\r\n\r\nInternship Duration: 02/06/25- 30/06/25\r\nLocation: Kolkata, West Bengal \r\nInternship Type: Volunteer\r\n\r\nObjective:\r\nTo support CRY’s mission of ensuring children’s rights by assisting in outreach, advocacy, research, and campaign efforts aimed at raising awareness and creating sustainable change at the grassroots level.\r\n','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,2,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-07-01',''),(127,1558,'','2','\r\nThe project aimed to support underprivileged children through basic education, digital literacy, and creative learning. It included teaching core subjects, guiding in computer labs, and organizing health and awareness sessions on mental health, menstruation, and domestic violence. Events like Child Labour Day and fun activities promoted social awareness and engagement. Overall, it focused on holistic development and community empowerment.\r\n\r\n\r\n','','DS','delhi','IILM University Gurugram','Ms savita','others','VE North Region ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-07-01',''),(128,1410,'','3','I visited Khiderpore and Munshigonj fields and interacted with local children and communities. I also journaled my learnings, documented data and feedback from children and CRY staff. I also created and compiled reports for CRY, comparing government data to ground reality and effect of CRY Public Action Groups','','PRAD/MA','Kolkata','Institute of Management IMNU, Nirma University, Sarkhej-Gandhinagar Highway, Ahmedabad, Gujarat - 382481','Rubina Haque','MBA','VE East Region ','','1,2',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-07-02',''),(129,468,'','3','Worked on documentation and data analysis across CRY’s partner projects focused on child labour, early marriage, and dropouts. Created reports and campaign material highlighting gaps in child protection. More exposure to field-level activities or direct stakeholder interactions would have added practical insight and enriched the learning experience.','','DS','Online','Woxsen University, Kamkole, Sangareddy District, 502345, Telangana, India','Dr. Sannaki Munna','Law','VE South ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-03',NULL,0,'2025-07-03',4,0,'','2025-07-02',''),(130,1417,'','3','The project included Research and Documentation and working with communities and children.','','VE','Kolkata','NIRMA UNIVERSITY, AHMEDABAD','Rubina Haque','others','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-07-02',''),(131,1408,'','3','Research and Documentation while serving the community.','','VE','Kolkata','Nirma University ,Sarkhej - Gandhinagar Hwy, Gota, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 382481','Rubina Haque','others','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-07-03',''),(132,1586,'','3','To improve the experience, CRY could create simple, reusable learning kits that make school sessions more fun and memorable for kids. On the operations side, using shared trackers and setting reminders can reduce last-minute rushes with reports. Fundraising could also feel more personal with ready templates and planned follow-ups. Small changes like these can make a big difference, both on-ground and online.','','BZ/Admin','bengaluru','PES UNIVERSITY, 100 Feet, Ring Rd, Banashankari 3rd Stage, Banashankari, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560085','Pradeep G B','others','VE South ','','1,9',NULL,3,'2025-07-10',NULL,0,'2025-07-10',4,0,'','2025-07-0