es, CUSAT, Kochi, Kerala','Monisha Murali','Law','VE South ','','11',NULL,2,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-07-04',''),(152,712,'','1,2','The Internship helped me lot to understand the children\'s in different ways and also help me as individual improve in various ways To control my emotions and feelings in better ways , I faced language barrier but its not effected to communicate with them , we do lot of activities with children\'s and they all are very happy to interacted with us the last day they become very sad and disappointed why because we say we are not coming next week. The CRY will help a lot of understanding this area.','','others','bengaluru','CENTRAL UNIVERSITY OF KARNATAKA','MONISHA MURALI','Social work','VE South ','','2',NULL,2,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-07-04',''),(153,712,'',NULL,'This internship helped me lot improve in the filed of Children\'s as we all of us know the children\'s tomorrow world. So that\'s why their education and overall learnings are very important. Now a days they are Stuck in some fields and they cant grow up. Kinds of these NGO will they help to do so many activities  they do and the children\'s are eagerly participating Through the summer camp will help their children\'s do so many activities and children\'s help to showcase their ideas.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,2,'2025-07-04',NULL,0,'2025-07-04',4,0,'','2025-07-04',''),(154,1196,'','2','During my internship at CRY, I served as a Peer Mentor for the Youth Change Champions (YCC) program. In this role, I was responsible for supporting a group of student interns by addressing their doubts, ensuring regular attendance in masterclasses, and tracking the timely completion of their assignments. Although the tasks became repetitive at times, the experience helped me cultivate qualities such as patience, accountability, and leadership. Overall, it was a rewarding experience.','','VE','Online','School of Legal Studies CUSAT, Kalamas