65,903,'','2','I took on the responsibility of collaborating with communities and implementing training programs. I believe I worked diligently and helped the staff work smoothly and effectively. But still, there lies scope for improvement. I interacted with the students and conducted various sessions with them. I understood their problems and helped them understand how they can overcome these problems. I even helped with administrative work and assisted in the legal work as well. ','','VE','delhi','RGNUL, Patiala, Punjab','Jitender Sir','Law','VE North Region ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-07-05',''),(166,1624,'',NULL,'During my internship at CRY, I worked with the Volunteer Engagement and Finance Departments. I contributed to legal awareness through presentation design on child rights and later supported financial documentation by verifying and filing vouchers. I applied social work principles and methods, gaining skills in legal research, content simplification, and financial compliance. The work emphasized transparency, accountability, and structured NGO processes.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-07-05',''),(167,1624,'',NULL,'During my internship at CRY, I worked with the Volunteer Engagement and Finance Departments. I contributed to legal awareness through presentation design on child rights and later supported financial documentation by verifying and filing vouchers. I applied social work principles and methods, gaining skills in legal research, content simplification, and financial compliance. The work emphasized transparency, accountability, and structured NGO processes.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-08',NULL,0,'2025-07-08',4,0,'','2025-07-05',''),(168,1604,'','','.','','GM','Kolkata','Symbiosis School of Economics, Pune ','Rubina Haque','Economics/statistics/Mathematics','VE East Region ','','1,9',NULL,1,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,'0000-00-00',0,0,