'),(175,1564,'','1,2','As an intern at CRY- Child Rights and You, i was tasked with planning, organizing and carrying out thoughtful activities as part of the \'Back To School - Summer Camp\' initiative at the Government Primary School, GHPS Police colony, Bengaluru. The team at Magadi PAG, consisting of Interns as well as volunteers, brainstormed ideas for the session and demonstrated immense coordination to impart values of kindness, team work and help the students in realization of self through active participation. ','','VE','bengaluru','NA','Mr. Manoj Thapa and Ms. Monisha Murali ','others','VE South ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-07-10',NULL,0,'2025-07-10',4,0,'','2025-07-10',''),(176,1187,'','1,9','The workload can be increased, in my opinion 2 days a week for this is not enough, other tha that no issues.','','VE','delhi','IILm University Greater Noida','Deeptansshu','Humanities','VE North Region ','','1,9',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-07-10',''),(177,2126,'','6','I HAVE LEARNT ABOUT RESEARCH AND DOCUMENTATION , FUNDRAISING AND NETWORKING','','VE','Kolkata','SHRI SIKHSHAYATAN COLLEGE 11, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal 700071','RUBINA HAQUE ','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-29',NULL,0,'2025-07-29',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(178,2129,'','6','The project is based on the idea of a child\'s safeguarding policy meaning the ways in which one can contribute there half for protecting a child from various issues.','','VE','Kolkata','11, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal, 700071','Rubina Haque','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-29',NULL,0,'2025-07-29',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(179,2130,'','6','Research and Documentation on Child Rights and Child Safeguarding Policy. Awareness regarding children\'s education to ensure a better and healthy future.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College 11, Lord Sinha Road Kolkata - 700071','Rubina Haque ','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,