d Rs.1770 and as a group assignment prepared two PPTs on Child Safeguarding Policy of CRY and Child Rights. ','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College, 11, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata 700071','Rubina Haque','Commerce','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,2,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(185,2133,'','6','As part of the internship, I have successfully completed both the presentations, one on the Child Safeguarding Policy and the other on Child Rights. In addition to this, I have also carried out and completed the fundraising task, ensuring active participation in all assigned responsibilities.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College 11, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal 700071','Rubina Haque','Commerce','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(186,2151,'','6','The PPT outlines CRY\'s Child Safeguarding Policy, designed to protect children from harm, abuse, neglect, exploitation. Based on the UNCRC & Indian Constitution, the policy upholds 0 tolerance for child abuse & provides guidelines for staff, interns, volunteers. The presentation highlights key principles, roles & responsibilities, emphasizing shared responsibility in safeguarding children & creating a safe environment for every child. Raised ₹1000 to support CRY\'s mission of empowering children.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College 11, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal 700071','RUBINA HAQUE','Commerce','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(187,1404,'','1,2','During my one-month internship at CRY (Child Rights and You), I worked on a field-based education and awareness project in collaboration with the Saksham Centre.  The aim of the project was to support underprivileged children through daily academic teaching, engaging activities.','','DS','delhi','Lovely Professional University , Jalandhar , Punjab','Smriti','Social work','VE North Region ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(188,1404,'',NULL,'During my one-month internship at CRY (Child Rights and You), I worked on a field-based education and awareness project in collaboration with the Saksham Centre and Nav Shrishti NGO. The aim of the project was to support underprivileged children through daily academic teaching, engaging activities, and awareness about child rights, especially in relation to missing children.\r\n','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(189,2127,'','6','I have learned about research and documentation, fundraising and networking.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College 11, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal - 700071','Rubina Haque','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-29',NULL,0,'2025-07-29',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(190,2125,'','3','Interned at CRY India, where I created two impactful presentations—one on child rights and another on child safeguarding policy. I also networked with influencers, encouraging them to share stories with the hashtag #BachpanKiDhun and tag CRY India to spread awareness. Wrapped up the experience by contributing to their fundraising efforts. A deeply meaningful journey toward protecting childhood.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal','Rubina Haque','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-29',NULL,0,'2025-07-29',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(191,2147,'','6','We made two power point presentations on the child safe guarding policy and child rights after doing proper research, contacted the influencer and uploaded a story for the promotion of world music day and approached raised funds from different people for the children for the basic needs like education etc ppts were made after the research was done ','','VE','Kolkata',' Shri Shikshayatan College, 11,Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal 700071','