s of children. It highlights CRY’s efforts in advocating for children\'s education, healthcare, and safety, as well as its role in policy implementation and awareness. The project aims to emphasize the importance of a rights-based approach to ensure holistic child development.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-29',NULL,0,'2025-07-29',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(196,2145,'','6','I have successfully completed & submitted both the presentations given to us by Rubina ma\'am on the topic Child rights and you.\r\nI have also completed the influencer task given to us whereby i was asked to approach influencer and ask them to create a story and tag cry,i will attach the image here as well.\r\nI have also successfully raised Rs. 1180 for cry on the ketto link provided to us by Rubina ma\'am, i will attach the image here below.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College,Elgin road,near Emami Market.','Rubina Haque','Commerce','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(197,2141,'','6','These two PPT\'s contain the the rights and laws which are there to protect children. These laws provide them education, prevents child labour and also protect them against abuse from adults. ','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College, 11, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal 700071','Rubina Haque ','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(198,2141,'',NULL,'I could have asked more influencers to share their experiences','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(199,2141,'',NULL,'I could have more influencers about their opinions and experiences ','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(200,2132,'','6','I have been an intern for the duration of 15 days. It\'s been a wonderful journey and I am grateful that I\'ve gained some experience as well as knowledge. ','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College 11, Lord Sinha Road, Kolkata, West Bengal, India, 700071','Rubina Haque ','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(201,1066,'','1,2','I was an intern at CRY. My fieldwork started from 11th June 2025, where my role was to teach children and help then learn new things. Our aim was to teach children and encourage them to have education. I visited government hospital and government school. I with my fellow internship prepared an act for the occassion of anti-child labour day and spread awareness and encourage children and their parents to let them study instead of sending them to work. I went to mandir and nearby places to teach. ','','VE','delhi','NMIMS, Mumbai','Jitendra Sir ','others','VE North Region ','','2,5',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(202,1066,'',NULL,'I was an intern at CRY. My fieldwork started from 11th June 2025. My role was to teach children and encourage them to have education and not work or do labour. I visited government school and government hospital. I went to mandir and nearby places to teach children. I with my fellow interns prepared an act for the occassion of anti-child labour day and spread awareness and encourage children and their parents to let their children study and not to send them for labour or any kind of work.       ','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,'','2025-07-11',''),(203,2137,'',NULL,'this project explores the importance of child safeguarding policy and child rights, focusing on how children can be protected, respected, and empowered in society. children are among the most vulnerable groups and need safe, supportive environments to grow and thrive.\r\ncsp is a set of rules and practices followed by organisations such as schools, ngo\'s, and institutions to prevent any form of abuse, neglect, or harm to children. it outlines procedures for identifying risks etc.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,2,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-12',''),(204,2137,'','6','this project explores the importance of child safeguarding policy and child rights, focusing on how children can be protected, respected, and empowered in society. children are among the most vulnerable groups and need safe, supportive environments to grow and thrive.\r\ncsp is a set of rules and practices followed by organisations such as schools, ngo\'s, and institutions to prevent any form of abuse, neglect, or harm to children. it outlines procedures for identifying risks etc.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan','Rubina Haque','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,2,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-12',''),(205,2119,'','6','I was assigned two projects: one on child safeguarding policy by CRY\'s rules, and another on children\'s rights, which required research.','','VE','Kolkata','SHRI SHIKSHAYATAN COLLEGE, 11, LORD SINHA ROAD, KOLKATA, WEST BENGAL','RUBINA HAQUE','others','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,2,'2025-07-29',NULL,0,'2025-07-29',4,0,'','2025-07-12',''),(206,2304,'','6','This presentation focuses on two very important and connected topics: Child Safeguarding Policy and Child Rights. The aim is to understand how we, as individuals and as a society, can create a safe and respectful world for children. The goal of this presentation is simple: to build a world where every child feels safe, heard, and valued. We can be more empathetic and be practical to cater to work towards change and making an impact.','','VE','Kolkata','SHRI SHIKSHAYATAN COLLEGE, LORD SINHA ROAD, KOLKATA','RUBINA HAQUE','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-12',''),(207,2134,'','6','This presentation focuses on two very important and connected topics child safeguarding policy and child rights. This aims at understanding how we , as individuals and as a society can create a safe space for children. They deserve the best of everything and opportunity to grow to their fullest potential and the goal is simple to be empathetic and practical thereby creating a safe environment where every child feels safe, heard and valued.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College, Lord Sinha Road, Kolkata','Rubina Haque','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-12',''),(208,2159,'','6','There were 4 assignments given to us while doing the internship of cry. I have completed all 4 of them. I have done a ppt on Child Safeguarding Policy and Child Rights, which was provided as an assignment. I have completed the task of uploading a picture in social media account while tagging \"CRY\". This was the third assignment done which fall under the \"Bachpan Ki Dhun\" campaign of CRY. I have also completed the task of fundraising for CRY. The total amount was Rs.1000 given to be collected.','','VE','Kolkata','Sri Shikshayatan College, 11, Lord Sinha Road, Elgin, Kolkata, West Bengal 700071','Rubina Haque','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,5',NULL,3,'2025-07-28',NULL,0,'2025-07-28',4,0,'','2025-07-12',''),(209,2128,'','6','My work here consisted of making two PowerPoint presentations on the topic of Child Rights and Child Safeguarding Policy. Along with that, a sum of rupees 1000 was raised as part of our fundraising assignment. Also took part in the Bachpan Ki Dhun trend.','','VE','Kolkata','Shri Shikshayatan College, Lord Sinha Road','Rubina Haque','Humanities','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-07-29',NULL,0,'2025-07-29',4,0,'','2025-07-12',''),(210,1596,'','1,2','Child who are underprivilege need a proper counselling for basic human values language , behaviour and many more i have mentioned it in my report of internship','','DS','delhi','Iilm university greater noida','Jitender sir','Humanities','VE West ','','2,5',NULL,3,'2025-07-18',NULL,0,'2025-07-18',4,0,