cation for those it matters the most . I have seen on ground and myself also taught one thing I can suggest some kids are far away from the mainstream it will take considerable effort to include them what I would suggest is a regular volunteer who can personally teach them which is often not possible in a school environment , focused teaching can help these students to get back in mainstream.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-08-07',NULL,0,'2025-08-07',4,0,'','2025-08-06',''),(252,938,'','1','This project involved collecting, cleaning, and analyzing data to identify patterns, trends, and insights. Various tools like Excel and Python were used for statistical analysis and data visualization. Based on the findings, a detailed report was prepared highlighting key outcomes and actionable recommendations to support data-driven decision-making.','','VE','delhi','Indian Institute Of Management Jammu , Jagti Campus -180021','Smriti Ma’am','others','VE North Region ','','11',NULL,0,'0000-00-00','2025-08-06',0,'0000-00-00',0,4,'','2025-08-06','Kinldy recheck the report and mention the work '),(253,1789,'','2','The internship at Nav Srishti, a CRY supported NGO, involved teaching H.E.M.S. classes developing process documents, creating a worksheet archive, launching the Green Corner initiative and organizing a career seminar. It addressed critical issues like abuse cases ans local admission scams. The work focused on instructional relief, institutional documentation, and student engagement in an under resourced education setting.','','DS','delhi','BML Munjal University, 67th Milestone, NH 48, Kapriwas, Haryana 122413, India','Ms. Savita','others','VE South ','','1,2',NULL,3,'2025-08-06',NULL,0,'2025-08-06',4,0,'','2025-08-06',''),(254,946,'','1,2','Could improve with more organizational order and giving feedback and brainstorming sessions with interns for their insights.','','VE','delhi','Aligarh Muslim University','Ms. Savita','Social work','VE North Region ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-08-11',NULL,0,'2025-08-11',4,0,'','2025-08-06',''),(255,938,'',NULL,'During my 4-week internship at CRY – Child Rights and You, I worked on \"Data Analysis and Report Writing.\" I conducted 30–40 student interviews and made 150+ calls to confirm participation and resolve issues. I maintained detailed records and provided feedback to enhance engagement strategies. This experience improved my communication, teamwork, and data-handling skills while supporting CRY’s mission.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,1,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,'0000-00-00',0,0,'','2025-08-06',''),(256,2215,'','3','The following document is a word file containing a simplified version of an act pertaining to children\'s rights and protection, The Juvenile Justice Act,2015.','','others','Kolkata','Sister Nivedita University Newton ','Rubina Haque','Law','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-08-20',NULL,0,'2025-08-20',4,0,'','2025-08-11',''),(257,938,'',NULL,'My overall experience with CRY was good and helped me grow personally and professionally. I learned how to spread awareness, handle data responsibly, and understood real ground-level issues related to child rights. The work gave me practical exposure and built my confidence. To future interns: it\'s a decent opportunity to learn, contribute, and understand how small actions can create some impact.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,1,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,'0000-00-00',0,0,'','2025-08-11',''),(258,938,'',NULL,'My overall experience with CRY was good and helped me grow personally and professionally. I learned how to spread awareness, handle data responsibly, and understood real ground-level issues related to child rights. The work gave me practical exposure and built my confidence. To future interns: it\'s a decent opportunity to learn, contribute, and understand how small actions can create some impact.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,1,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,'0000-00-00',0,0,'','2025-08-11',''),(259,1084,'','3','It\'s a case story documentation of several documented stories which are converted in a storytelling format.','','others','Kolkata','Amity University Kolkata, Newtown ','Rubina Haque ','others','VE East Region ','','1,9',NULL,3,'2025-08-20',NULL,0,'2025-08-20',4,0,'','2025-08-11',''),(260,938,'',NULL,'My overall experience with CRY was good and helped me grow personally and professionally. I learned how to spread awareness, handle data responsibly, and understood real ground-level issues related to child rights. The work gave me practical exposure and built my confidence. To future interns: it\'s a decent opportunity to learn, contribute, and understand how small actions can create some impact.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,1,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,'0000-00-00',0,0,'','2025-08-12',''),(261,1700,'','1','The Class 12 Handbook is a comprehensive, student-friendly guide designed to help you excel in your final school year. Covering all major subjects with concise notes, key formulas, solved examples, and exam tips, it simplifies complex concepts for quick understanding. Its organized layout, easy-to-read format, and revision-friendly content make it the perfect companion for board exam preparation and last-minute review.','','VE','Online','NA','Rubina Haque','Law','VE North Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-08-20',NULL,0,'2025-08-20',4,0,'','2025-08-13',''),(262,361,'','3','Worked on research, documentation, and fundraising activities at CRY. Prepared advocacy presentations on Child Rights and Safeguarding Policy, compiled progress reports for Project Pragati, and contributed to a fundraising campaign supporting girl child education. Combined legal analysis with socio-economic insights to create impactful materials and mobilize resources for education and child welfare.','','PRAD/MA','Kolkata','Sister Nivedita University, Kolkata','Rubina Haque','Economics/statistics/Mathematics','VE East Region ','','1,6',NULL,3,'2025-08-20',NULL,0,'2025-08-20',4,0