ght into child rights laws and how they work on the ground. I learnt to simplify legal concepts, gained confidence, and made meaningful memories while contributing to a larger cause. A great place for any intern to learn and grow.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,1,'0000-00-00',NULL,0,'0000-00-00',0,0,'','2025-09-05',''),(286,2369,'','3','Cry (Child Rights and You) can improve as a community service by strengthening grassroots engagement and expanding local volunteer networks. They could provide more skill-based training for volunteers, enabling them to contribute beyond fundraising, such as in education, healthcare, or counseling. Increasing transparency about fund allocation would also build deeper trust with donors. Partnering with schools, colleges, and corporates can widen awareness and encourage youth participation. Expandi','','VE','Kolkata','Lovely Professional University, Phagwara ','Rubina Haque','Engineering','VE East Region ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-09-10',NULL,0,'2025-09-10',4,0,'','2025-09-10',''),(287,2370,'','3','Manish Kumar \r\n06-07-2025\r\n06-08-2025\r\nVolunteered at Dhappa\r\nVolunteered at Momin high school \r\nMade report on Cry website \r\nHybrid online-offline internship','','VE','Kolkata','Lovely Professional University,Phagwara,Punjab','Rubina Haque','Engineering','VE West ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-09-10',NULL,0,'2025-09-10',4,0,'','2025-09-10',''),(288,2256,'','3','I would have been very happy if I got a little more time at CRY to engage in more activities, but my tenure was short as prescribed by my university. I really wish I could spend some more time here.','','VE','Kolkata','Indian Institute Of Social Welfare And Business Management (IISWBM)','Rubina Haque','Social work','VE East Region ','','1,2',NULL,3,'2025-09-15',NULL,0,'2025-09-15',4,0,'','2025-09-12',''),(289,2243,'','3','Handling financial documents at CRY office by using vouchers.\r\nDocument and analysed at results of students at CRY school.','','Communications','Kolkata','College street campus ','Rubina Haque ','Social work','VE West ','','2',NULL,3,'2025-09-15',NULL,0,'2025-09-15',4,0,'','2025-09-12',''),(290,2243,'',NULL,'Financial documents with vouchers and handling the documents and analysed the results of students at cry school.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-09-15',NULL,0,'2025-09-15',4,0,'','2025-09-12',''),(291,2243,'',NULL,'Financial documents with vouchers and handling the documents and analysed the results of students at cry school.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-09-15',NULL,0,'2025-09-15',4,0,'','2025-09-12',''),(292,2243,'',NULL,'Financial documents with vouchers and handling the documents and analysed the results of students at cry school.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-09-15',NULL,0,'2025-09-15',4,0,'','2025-09-12',''),(293,2249,'','3','Participating in this project as an intern has been a great experience, and I am hopeful that it will help the students strengthen their foundational knowledge.','','DS','Kolkata','IISWBM, H9G6+C8F, Madan Mohan Sen St, Behind Ph.D Section, Calcutta University, College Square West, Calcutta University, College Square, Kolkata, West Bengal 700073','Rubina Hauque','Social work','VE East Region ','','2,5',NULL,3,'2025-09-15',NULL,0,'2025-09-15',4,0,'','2025-09-12',''),(294,2728,'','3','Contributed to the Grant Management Team by analyzing MoUs, conducting research, and evaluating programs to ensure transparency and accountability. Supported evidence-based decision-making that strengthened partnerships and maximized impact for social development initiatives.','','GM','Online','NA','Rubina Haque','Economics/statistics/Mathematics','VE East Region ','','1',NULL,3,'2025-10-08',NULL,0,'2025-10-08',4,0,'','2025-09-25',''),(295,2201,'','3','Ensuring Safety and Security for Every Child.\r\nRecommendations for Improvement:\r\nCRY’s policy is strong, but future methods can improve by adding digital awareness drives, grassroots monitoring, third-party audits, and child-led feedback systems. This will ensure greater accountability, transparency, and adaptability in safeguarding children.\r\nHere is the link :- https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1POec0gsnPaFLr6wmW7mxr1weHj5XD617?usp=sharing','','Finance','Kolkata','Sealdah','Rubina Haque Ma\'am, Sadeque Ali Sir and Bijoy Saha Sir.','Commerce','VE East Region ','','9,10',NULL,3,'2025-10-08',NULL,0,'2025-10-08',4,0,'','2025-09-25',''),(296,2265,'','3','During my internship at CRY (Child Rights and You), I worked on analyzing data related to various child rights initiatives run by the organization. I prepared reports and presentations on topics like child safeguarding, child rights, education, child labour, and early childhood care. Through this project, I learned how data can help understand real issues faced by children and how it can be used to make programs more effective. ','','VE','Online','Rohini Sector 16 New Delhi 110089','Rubina Haque','Commerce','VE East Region ','','1,9',NULL,3,'2025-10-29',NULL,0,'2025-10-29',4,0,'','2025-10-23',''),(297,2265,'',NULL,'During my internship at CRY (Child Rights and You), I worked on analyzing data related to various child rights initiatives run by the organization. I prepared reports and presentations on topics like child safeguarding, child rights, education, child labour, and early childhood care. Through this project, I learned how data can help understand real issues faced by children and how it can be used to make programs more effective.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,3,'2025-10-29',NULL,0,'2025-10-29',4,0,'','2025-10-24','');
