INSERT INTO `interns` VALUES (1,'Bitopi','Bitopi',0,'09999999999','baruah.bitopi@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2009-03-25',2,101,4,373,'','2,4',10,'','','','1740653284Advit.pdf','','hhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh','nnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnn','5','',2,'6','','','2025-02-27','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(2,'Vismaya','P L',0,'7012045976','plvismaya7@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2004-09-25',2,101,18,1346,'','1,2,3',8,'','','','1740678154CV_VISMAYA_PL_pdf.pdf','','NSS Volunteer, Legal Aid Clinic Member, Interned at Chamber of Justice PG Ajithkumar, High Court of Kerala, Interned at Kerala Legislative Assemebly, Interned at District Legal Service Authority, Volunteer at National Lok Adalat 2024.','If chosen for an Internship with CRY, I am looking forward to interacting with children and communities to understand their problems and apply my legal acumen to find a practical solution. My biggest contribution would be my legal knowledge. ','1','',2,'4','','','2025-02-27','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(3,'Prashansa ','Singh ',0,'9770958760','singhsprashansa@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2004-10-21',2,101,20,1467,'','1,2,3',9,'','','','1740678290PRASHANSA_SINGH_CV_cv_updated.pdf','','I have volunteered in hamari Pehchan NGO where I have made posters, did fundraising etc.','If I get the chance to intern with CRY, I want to actively contribute to its mission of helping children. I’ll bring fresh ideas, enthusiasm, and a problem-solving mindset to support projects, spread awareness, and engage with communities.','5','',1,'4','','','2025-02-27','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(4,'Siya ','Garg',0,'9389308678','l23blbu0064@bennett.edu.in','','','',0,0,'2005-06-11',2,101,10,693,'','1,2,5',9,'','','','1740680131Siya_CV.pdf','','I have been actively involved in various volunteering initiatives focused on social welfare and community development. One of my key contributions was organizing and performing *Nukkad Natak* to raise awareness about child marriage, using street play','If chosen for a CRY internship, I aim to leverage my experience in Nukkad Natak, community outreach, and field research to drive awareness and advocacy. My skills in engagement, sustainability initiatives, and grassroots mobilization will support CRY','4','',2,'4','','','2025-02-27','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(5,'Leah Rachel ','Mathew',0,'8113873557','mathew.leahrachel@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2004-02-09',2,101,18,1346,'','1,2,9',9,'','','','1740680820Leah_MathewCV.pdf','','At College, I interned at various institutions, including the High Court and the Kerala Legislative Assembly. As President of the Women\'s Wing, I led initiatives for cancer patients and sexual abuse awareness. I also volunteer with NSS n YWCA.','I can bring strong advocacy skills and a passion for child rights to CRY. My experience in community outreach and project management will help drive impactful initiatives, while my commitment to social justice aligns with CRY\'s mission of empowerment','4','',2,'4','','','2025-02-27','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(6,'NITHYASREE','S',0,'7034840470','nithyasreesujakumari@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2004-11-05',2,101,18,1346,'','2,3,5',9,'','','','1740682133Curriculam_Vitae.pdf','','I haven\'t volunteered with an NGO before, but as a law student passionate about social justice, I am eager to contribute through legal research, advocacy, and policy work, gaining hands-on experience while supporting CRY’s mission effectively.','As a law student committed to social justice, I aim to support CRY’s goal through legal research and advocacy. I believe my skills can help drive systemic change and empower communities, ensuring children remain a national priority.','4','',2,'4','','','2025-02-28','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(7,'Palak ','Singla',0,'8955891368','singlapalak89@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2004-05-02',2,101,29,2344,'','1,2,8,11',9,'','','','1740687747my_cv.docx','','I celebrated by birthday and use to visit ROBIN HOOD ARMY kids ( their drives ) and my one month internship under the guidance of senior advocate sri ganganagar district court - mahender singh rathore ','It make me smile when other\'s smile bcz of me . Acc. To me , Hand in need is great deed so I\'ll give my head to foot for their welfare ','8','By a renowned supreme court advocate - shourajeet chakravarty',1,'12','','','2025-02-28','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(8,'Kashish','Chouhan',0,'8085622468','kashishchouhan1212@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2003-12-12',2,101,20,1467,'','9',9,'','','','1740758823kashish_12__.pdf','','As of now, I have not had the opportunity to engage in formal volunteering or internship experiences. However, I am eager to apply my knowledge and skills in a professional setting and am actively seeking opportunities to gain hands-on experience .','If chosen for an internship with CRY, I aim to contribute by leveraging my analytical, technical, and problem-solving skills to support child rights initiatives. I am eager to assist in research, data analysis, and digital outreach while learning fro','1','',3,'12','','','2025-02-28','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(9,'Shaikh','Zoya',0,'09616960731','zoyas1173@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2003-09-21',2,101,20,1458,'','3,5,10,11',10,'','','','1740758892RESUME_20ZOYA-1-1.pdf','','I don\'t have any past experience','I would love to do something for my surrounding and help the needy.','1','',1,'4','','','2025-02-28','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(10,'KRISH','JAIN',0,'9212998970','ipm06krishj@iimrohtak.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2005-08-27',1,101,10,697,'','2,6,7',9,'','','','1740772659Krish_Jain_CV_pdf.pdf','','I have volunteered with the Confederation of UNESCO Clubs and Associations of India, where I helped promote international understanding through the Mitsubishi Asian Children\'s Enikki Festa. I was also part of the UN Information Center for India and B','If chosen for an internship with CRY, I would bring dedication, creativity, and strong organizational skills to the team. I aim to contribute by raising awareness, organizing impactful campaigns, and engaging communities effectively. My experience in','5','',1,'8','','','2025-03-01','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(11,'Achala','Paneru',0,'7078370738','achalapaneru34@gmail.com','efb6717634b6b0bd1ceb47d22b49d0cb','','',0,0,'2001-11-03',2,101,35,2801,'','1,9,10',10,'','','','1740803337Achala_Resume.pdf','','Volunteer and Vice President at C.H.E.T.N.A. NGO.\r\nVice President of Home Science Society, GBPUAT, Pantnagar.\r\nEx- intern at Pledge a Smile Foundation.\r\nInternship and training from France under DEFIAA Student Exchange Programme.','I am eager to bring my skills in research, communication, and teamwork to your organization. I can assist in gathering data, preparing reports, and conducting outreach to educate communities on child rights issues. My ability to work collaboratively ','2','',1,'4','Dear, Achala Paneru,\n\nNainital&nbsp; ,Uttarakhand\n\n\nWe are happy to confirm your Online internship with CRY India with Smriti Rustagi&nbsp; team for a period of 4 weeks . The date of internship commencement will be 08 Apr 2025.\n\nYour internship will comprise of you working with us as an Operations Interns for an upcoming program along with any other work which might come in your way looking into your skill sets.\n\n\nAs an intern with CRY, you will be required to adhere to the rules and policies of the organisation. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:\n\n\n Respect for Human Dignity\n\n Transparency\n\n Innovation \n\n accountability \n\n Secularism\n\n Non Violence\n\n Working in Partnership\n\n During the internship you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.&nbsp;\n\nRegards\n\nSmriti Rustagi\nAssistant Manager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-04-25','2025-03-20',8,'2025-05-07',0,NULL,'2025-04-08'),(12,'Satvika','D',0,'9515121704','satvika9908@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2002-02-15',2,101,32,2549,'','1,9',11,'','','','1740830990Resume.pdf','','While I haven\'t formally volunteered or interned before, I am deeply passionate about social impact, especially child welfare. My enthusiasm for making a difference motivates me to take this opportunity seriously. I am eager to contribute my skills.','I aim to contribute through research, problem-solving, and analytical skills. I’m eager to support CRY’s initiatives with data-driven projects and strategy development, making a meaningful impact through structured, behind-the-scenes work.','1','',1,'4','','','2025-03-01','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(13,'Pranjal ','Chauhan',0,'9319417736','pranjalchauhan7225@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2001-11-12',2,101,10,698,'','2',10,'','','','1740831466CV-Pranjal.pdf','','Previously, I worked with an online firm called Harugakuin, which specialized in teaching Japanese. I served as a Japanese teacher and also collaborated with the social media team to manage their online presence. ','With experience in teaching underprivileged children and managing social media, I can create engaging educational content, support outreach programs, and enhance CRY’s digital presence to raise awareness about child rights. ','1','',3,'4','','','2025-03-01','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(14,'Ansh','Dogra',0,'8810611634','anshdogra005@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2005-07-27',1,101,10,698,'','1',9,'','','','1740837066Ansh_Dogra_-13.pdf','','Managed placement events and coordinated with 10+ HR professionals.\r\nFacilitated student-employer interactions and improved placement Opportunities. ','Utilize Excel & Power BI to analyze donation trends and optimize fund allocation.\r\n\r\nDevelop data-driven fundraising and outreach strategies to enhance CRY’s impact.\r\n\r\nStreamline operational processes for efficient project execution and assessment.\r\n','7','',1,'4','','','2025-03-01','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(15,'Sasha','Borker',0,'8904128690','sasha.borker@gmail.com','221204affe0de450c671aaf2d1e0243c','','',0,0,'2006-01-12',2,101,17,1107,'','1,2,3',9,'','','','1740923392Sasha_Resume_2025.pdf','','I have done an internship with ISBR school of business, as a part of which we founded an NGO \"The Happy Folks Club\", for senior citizens.','I am a creative and hardworking person. I can help with research and ideation. I work well with canva and have good c. I have teamwork and leadership skills gained through experience. I can also help with analysing data (excel basics & analysing)','4','',2,'6','Dear Sasha,&nbsp;This is to confirm your internship with CRY Bangalore for a period from 28th April to 28th MAy, 2025. As an Intern with CRY, you will be required to adhere to the rules and policies of the organization. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:&nbsp;·&nbsp; &nbsp; Dignity·&nbsp; &nbsp; Equality·&nbsp; &nbsp; Justice·&nbsp; &nbsp; Integrity&nbsp;During the Internship, you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.&nbsp;We welcome you onboard the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you. Please acknowledge the receipt of this offer letter by replying your confirmation of joining to this email.Please fill this registration form before you start your internship with us: https://volunteeraction.cry.in/Registration/RegisterIntern.aspxWe wish you all the best.&nbsp;Regards,','This is to certify that Sasha Borker, has interned with Child Rights and You (Bangalore) from April 28th to June 30th, 2025. We acknowledgeSasha’s contribution towards ensuring lasting change in the lives of children. We wish her all the very best for her future endeavours!','2025-05-29','2025-07-15',8,'2025-05-29',1,'certificate/318325010.pdf','2025-05-12'),(16,'Arunima ','Mukherjee',0,'9311007230','marunima42@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'1999-07-25',2,101,10,698,'','4',9,'','','','1740982020Arunima_Mukherjee_Resume.pdf','','This is the first time I am applying to Inter at an NGO.','My aim is to help CRY with my skills related to over all digital marketing.','2','',3,'12','Dear, Arunima  Mukherjee,\n\nSouth Delhi ,Delhi\n\nWe are happy to confirm your Hybrid internship with CRY India with&nbsp; Sohini&nbsp; , Communication Team&nbsp; for a period of 12 weeks covering the months of May-June-July, 2025. The date of internship commencement will be 09 May 2025.\n\nYour internship will comprise of you working with us as an Operations Interns for an upcoming program along with any other work which might come in your way looking into your skill sets.\n\n\nAs an intern with CRY, you will be required to adhere to the rules and policies of the organisation. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:\n\n\n Respect for Human Dignity\n\n Transparency\n\n Innovation \n\n accountability \n\n Secularism\n\n Non Violence\n\n Working in Partnership\n\n During the internship you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.&nbsp;\n\nRegards\n\nSmriti Rustagi\nAssistant Manager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-03-03','2025-03-20',6,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-09'),(17,'Samreen','Sayyed',0,'9321432533','samreensayyed254@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2005-07-28',2,101,21,1894,'','1,3,4,7',9,'','','','1740983869CV.pdf','','I interned at Frontiers Welfare Society (Sep–Oct 2024) as a Legal Intern, conducting legal research, case commentaries, and debates on civil proceedings and judicial appointments. This experience strengthened my research and advocacy skills. ','As a law student passionate about child rights, I aim to contribute through legal research, policy analysis, and advocacy. My communication skills can aid in outreach, and I’m eager to engage in fieldwork to support CRY’s mission of ensuring a better','2','',3,'6','','','2025-03-03','0000-00-00',2,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(18,'Harini','BS',0,'8123027168','harinisrivathsa@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2006-06-16',2,101,17,1107,'','10,11',9,'','','','1740993298HARINI_BS.pdf','','I have volunteered in multiple college and school activities \r\nMarketing & Promotions Volunteer – PES University CFO Lounge 3.0\r\nAsiana times summer intern \r\nschool cultural head ( organised multiple events )','I am to contribute by leveraging my skills in finance and accounting . Majorly in Financial Analysis and budgeting and in Cost optimization by identifying opportunities to streamline costs and enhance financial sustainability for CRY\'s initiative ','2','',3,'6','','','2025-03-03','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(19,'Tanisha','Garg',0,'9137501721','shwetagarg009900@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2006-08-09',2,101,21,1842,'','1,2,4',9,'','','','1740996977Tanisha_Resume.pdf','','1. In 2024, I volunteered at an NGO  Awaz-E-Niswan, Kurla, which works toward empowering underprivileged Muslim women. During my volunteer period, I taught women English and music.\r\n2. FWS Online Internship, the program aimed to improve legal research','As a student of law, I can add value to CRY by 1. legal research and policy analysis, 2. Identifying and documenting cases, 3. Awareness campaigns, 4. Drafting & Reviewing Legal Documents as well as 5. working on legal strategies. ','4','',2,'4','Dear Tanisha Garg,\n\n\n\nWe are happy to confirm your On Ground internship with CRY India with the Program team for a period of 4 weeks covering the month of June 2025. The date of internship commencement will be 01 Jun 2025.\n\nYour internship will comprise of you working with us as an on field intern for an program along with any other work which might come in your way looking into your skill sets.\n\n\nAs an intern with CRY, you will be required to adhere to the rules and policies of the organisation. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:\n\n\n Respect for Human Dignity\n\n Transparency\n\n Innovation \n\n accountability \n\n Secularism\n\n Non Violence\n\n Working in Partnership\n\n During the internship you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.&nbsp;\n\nRegards\n\nRenita Lopes\nAssociate\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-03-03','2025-03-20',6,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-06-01'),(20,'K ','Shobhika',0,'9742278925','shobhi.k06@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2004-06-10',2,101,17,1107,'','1,2,7',9,'','','','1741001398K_Shobhika_CV_.pdf','','-Legal internships at firms and government offices . \r\n-Fundraising intern at muskurahat foundation . ','I aim to provide the children of CRY with the best i can through the skills i can offer which would ultimately benefit the foundation as well . I hope that volunteering at CRY would definitely help me learn many new aspects of life . ','4','',1,'4','','','2025-03-03','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(21,'Sarvesh ','Kumar ',0,'6206219598','sarveshsiswan@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2003-04-27',1,101,34,2575,'','2,11',10,'','','','1741003862sarvesh_pdf_pdf.pdf','','1. Volunteering in Mahakumbh Mela 2025 organised by HCL Foundation and Development Alternative \r\n2. Research intern in Mahakumbh Mela 2025 conducted by information and public relation department lucknow ','If chosen for an internship with CRY, I will add value through community engagement, research, and program implementation. My experience in PRA and village stays will help mobilize communities, while my research skills will support impact assessments','2','',2,'4','Dear, Sarvesh  Kumar ,\n\nAllahabad&nbsp; ,Uttar Pradesh\n\nWe are happy to confirm your On Ground internship with CRY India with the( Need to Write ) team for a period of 4 weeks .&nbsp;The date of internship commencement will be 10 Jun 2025.\n\nYour internship will comprise of you working directly working&nbsp; with children Interns for an upcoming program along with any other work which might come in your way looking into your skill sets.\n\n\nAs an intern with CRY, you will be required to adhere to the rules and policies of the organisation. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:\n\n\n Respect for Human Dignity\n\n Transparency\n\n Innovation \n\n accountability \n\n Secularism\n\n Non Violence\n\n Working in Partnership\n\n During the internship you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.&nbsp;\n\nRegards\n\nSmriti Rustagi\nAssistant Manager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-03-03','2025-03-11',7,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-06-10'),(22,'Rucha','Ganu',0,'7888002880','24010126023@symlaw.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-10-03',2,101,21,1837,'','1,2,3',9,'','','','1741005352Rucha_Ganu_CV.pdf','','As a first year, I have not volunteered, however I have completed an online internship at Insolvency Law Forum, for research work.','As a first-year student in law, I have cultivated the passion and zeal to work, combined with practical knowledge. I pride myself on my communication and organisational skills, along with empathy. This opportunity will help me work in  real-life. ','1','',2,'4','','','2025-03-03','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(23,'Akanksha','Gupta',0,'9986776571','akankshagupta605@hotmail.com','','','',0,0,'1994-05-15',2,101,17,1107,'','3,10,11',10,'','','','1741006871Akanksha_Gupta_resume.pdf','','i have been an active member of rotary and have done many projects with rotary. I have recently written a book of poems and it will be published soon. I have done my MBA and have done many projects with big brands and companies. ','i want to create an impact and give back to society. I want to use my skills to teach and support in any way i can','1','',3,'4','','','2025-03-03','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(24,'Gayatri ','Nair',0,'9999560729','gayatri.nair0602@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2002-06-20',2,101,13,909,'','1,2,9',10,'','','','1741007930B24439_Gayatri_Nair_CRP_1723906184000.pdf','','Market analyst intern at Cyberfrat','Streamline the process and contribute to a positive cause','1','',3,'4','Dear, Gayatri  Nair,\n\nJhajjar&nbsp; ,Haryana\n\nWe are happy to confirm your Hybrid internship with CRY India with&nbsp; Corporate Partnerships team&nbsp; a period of 4 weeks&nbsp; The date of internship commencement will be 05 Jun 2025.\n\nYour internship will comprise of you working with us as an Operations Intern