pervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.\n\nRegards\n\nRubina Haque\nAssociate\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','This is to certify that Parul Raj, student of Amity University Jharkhand has interned with CRY - Child Rights and You from Jun 02nd 2025 to Jun 30th 2025. During her internship tenure, she worked with the Volunteer Enagagement function. She was primarily engageged in simplifying laws relating to Child Rights and participated in CRY events and campaigns. We found Parul Raj to be hard-working and good at her work. We wish her all the very best in her future endeavours.','2025-06-02','2025-07-04',8,'2025-07-04',1,'certificate/2056274634.pdf','2025-06-02'),(429,'Dishari','Khan',0,'8597985235','disharikhan01@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'1998-06-06',2,101,18,1346,'','1,4,9',10,'','','','1743229138CV_Dishari.pdf','','Observership, Jan Chetna Manch-Bokaro (Dec 2023) – Engaged in outreach on antenatal/postnatal care, mental health visits, and OPD assistance. Observed monthly mental health clinic, documented field activities via photos/videos, boosting social media ','If chosen for an internship with CRY, I aim to contribute through my skills in research, outreach, and social media engagement to enhance awareness and advocacy efforts. I am eager to assist in fieldwork, documentation, and program implementation.','5','',3,'8','','','2025-03-29','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(430,'Sunaina','Dasgupta',0,'9818449780','sunainadasgupta800@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'1994-02-02',2,101,36,2884,'','1,2,5',11,'','','','1743232153sunainadasgupta_CRY_internship.pdf','','Volunteered with Friendicoes, a non-profit animal shelter in New Delhi as a National Service Scheme volunteer\r\nInterned at PRADAN (Professional Assistance for Development Action) and worked in Bihar