d to a sustained and productive partnership with you.&nbsp;\n\nRegards\n\nRenita Lopes\nAssociate\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-04-09','2025-04-09',6,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(625,'Barsha Rani','Mishra',0,'8697089443','mishrashibani71@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2005-05-10',2,101,36,2833,'','2,7,11',9,'','','','1744179191Barsha_CV_Resume.pdf','','I\'ve done volunteering work under my college two or three times and visited schools to interact with the children,and then under an animal ngo for welfare of animals.','I want to give out my skills to other children who are in need and are willing to learn. I\'ve skill set to offer like spoken English, computer skills, hindi spoken and i would also want to interact with them and make a happy environment for them.','8','Google',3,'4','','','2025-04-09','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(626,'Murry Shashank','Raman',0,'8777506923','shashankrmn@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2005-11-27',1,101,36,2833,'','2,9,11',8,'','','','1744179946resume.pdf','','I\'ve not done volunteer work officially ever but I\'ve volunteered to help children and under animal organization.','I possess skills like UI/UX and other basic computer soft skills. I want to volunteer my skills to the children so that they can go forward in life and make contributions with their skills and I also want to set a happy place for them through it.','4','',3,'4','','','2025-04-09','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(628,'Krishna ','Kumar Shukla',0,'7044767855','Krishnashu06.india@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2006-04-10',1,101,36,2833,'','2,5,9',9,'','','','1744180515Krishna_Kumar_Shukla_(2)_(1)1.pdf','','None','I would love to help childrens and the organization for the betterment','4','',2,'4','','','2025-04-09','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(629,'Manasvi','Singh',0,'8802538873','manasvi.singhd@gmail.com','','','