table evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.\n\nRegards\n\nRubina Haque\nAssociate\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','This is to certify that Abhradeep Chowdhury, student of Alliance School of Law, Alliance University has interned with CRY - Child Rights and You from Jul 01st 2025 to Jul 29th 2025. During his internship tenure, he worked with the Finance team. He was primarily involved in assignments such as Research and documentation, Verification of bills and vouchers of various grants and Successfully developed an impactful presentation on CRY’s Child Safeguarding Policy, reflecting a strong understanding of child protection principles and a commitment to promoting safe practices. We found Abhradeep Chowdhury to be hard-working and good at his work. We wish him all the very best in his future endeavours.','2025-07-28','2025-07-29',8,'2025-07-29',1,'certificate/1813787150.pdf','2025-07-01'),(674,'Rajpal','Bishnoi ',0,'7304422831','rajpalbishnoi363@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2008-05-04',1,101,21,1793,'','1,2,11',8,'','','','1744269358CV.pdf','','Worked 6 months at Root 19 Solutions as Assistant Teacher: taught, corrected papers, gave feedback. Volunteered 1 month at Bhavesh Shah Tuitions, helping students with doubts and concepts.Gaining skills in teaching, time management and empathy.','I can add value by teaching students both academic and life skills, guiding them toward future opportunities. I\'m eager to explore other roles within CRY too, as I connect deeply with children and want to support them in every possible way.','4','',3,'4','','','2025-04-10','0000-00-00',2,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(675,'Saanvi ','Nanda',