th you.\n\nRegards\n\nManoj Thapa\nManager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-04-17','2025-05-16',6,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-06-02'),(855,'NIDHI','RAWAT',0,'09958143182','nrawat120902@gmail.com','70fb3ccf503784113e20d259e5acb17c','','',0,0,'2002-09-12',2,101,10,693,'','1,3,4',10,'','','','1744893342CV-_Nidhi_Rawat.pdf','','none','Offering strong research and writing skills. Supporting collaborative and empathetic work environments. Contributing creatively with an intent to make the organization’s work more accessible and impactful.','8','Through my University',3,'4','Dear, NIDHI RAWAT,\n\nDelhi ,Delhi\n\nWe are happy to confirm your Hybrid internship with CRY India with Volunteer Enaggement team for a period of 4 weeks&nbsp; The date of internship commencement will be 15 May 2025.\n\nYour internship will comprise of you working with us as an Operations Interns for an upcoming program along with any other work which might come in your way looking into your skill sets.\n\n\nAs an intern with CRY, you will be required to adhere to the rules and policies of the organisation. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:\n\n\n Respect for Human Dignity\n\n Transparency\n\n Innovation \n\n accountability \n\n Secularism\n\n Non Violence\n\n Working in Partnership\n\n During the internship you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.\n\nRegards\n\nSmriti Rustagi\nAssistant Manager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','This is to certify that NIDHI RAWAT, student of Dr. 