ns for an upcoming program along with any other work which might come in your way looking into your skill sets.\n\n\nAs an intern with CRY, you will be required to adhere to the rules and policies of the organisation. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:\n\n\n Respect for Human Dignity\n\n Transparency\n\n Innovation \n\n accountability \n\n Secularism\n\n Non Violence\n\n Working in Partnership\n\n During the internship you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.\n\nRegards\n\nSmriti Rustagi\nAssistant Manager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-05-22','2025-05-06',8,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-20'),(982,'Meghavi','Tank',0,'9173244773','mdtank02@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2002-04-01',2,101,12,715,'','1,9,10,11',9,'','','','1745331662Meghavi_Tank.pdf','','Got it! Here\'s a version within **250 characters**:\r\n\r\nVolunteered at VISAMO Kids Foundation and led rural education impact research at Lokniketan Trust. Interned in financial modeling and R&D, using R, Python, and SPSS to support data-driven insights ','I aim to contribute and add value by using my skills and expertise, ensuring that every child rights are protected not just for the sake of CRY\'s mission, but overall country\'s children rights are protected through my contribution in this internship','5','',1,'6','','','2025-04-22','0000-00-00',2,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(983,'Harsahib','Singh Gill',0,'9872216566','ipm24050@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2005-10-16',1,101,15,989,'','5,9,10',9,'','','','1745331769IPM24050_Harsahib_Singh_Gill.pdf','','N/A','I aim to contribute by initiating