ship with you.\n\nRegards\n\nSmriti Rustagi\nAssistant Manager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','This is to certify that Diya Agarwal, student of Indian Institute Of management, Jammu has interned with CRY - Child Rights and You from May 12th 2025 to Jun 12th 2025. During her internship tenure, she worked with the DS. She was primarily involved as a Research and documentation, involved in reserach on corporeates and engagement ideas Data Analysis intern and We found Diya Agarwal to be hard-working and good at her work. We wish her all the very best in her future endeavours.','2025-05-14','2025-08-05',8,'2025-08-01',1,'certificate/1558015716.pdf','2025-05-12'),(1008,'SAASWATHI','NEERAJ',0,'6238233727','ipm24101@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-09-11',2,101,15,989,'','1,3,4,7',9,'','','','1745400742IPM24101_Saaswathi_Neeraj.pdf','','I was a Stock Market intern at FinPro Wealth where I learnt about the fundamentals of the working of a stock market and prepared two in- detailed research reports on the financials of companies. ','I aim to utilize my creativity and teamwork skills to contribute to the mission of CRY, enhance my current skills and bring forward a fresh perspective to the table. ','8','College Placement Committee',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1009,'Diksha ','Taly',0,'8989186940','dikshataly@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2006-03-29',2,101,15,989,'','1,2,3,6,7',9,'','','','1745403151IPM24037_Diksha_Taly_CV_IIMJ.pdf','','Crowdfunding Intern at Muskurahat Foundation (Jul’24 - Aug’24): Raised funds online for underprivileged kids’ education, created impactful content, coordinated strategies, and maintained donor communication.','I aim to add value by leveraging my research skills to support impactful CSR initiatives, document insights that drive action, and contribute to effective communication materials that amplify CRY’s mi