, engaged stakeholders, and ensured flawless execution of two major academic events.by efficiently coordinating logistics.','Inspired by CRY’s mission for children’s rights, use Excel & data-visualization to optimize KPIs; drive social-media & fundraising campaigns; create concise impact presentations; and coordinate CRY events & field activities through teamwork.','8','Placement Committee',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1040,'Purvi','Golechha',0,'09313328852','ipm24090@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-03-16',2,101,15,989,'','1,3,11',9,'','','','1745410290IPM24090_CV.pdf','','1) FinPRO Wealth: Gained practical exposure to capital markets and mutual funds while developing skills in Data Analysis, Excel and financial performance reporting.','I would:\r\n1) Connect the children with creative arts to boost their creative freedom.\r\n2) Take up initiatives to uplift children.\r\n3) Assist children to voice their concerns.\r\nIn turn making this world a happier place for children!','5','',1,'4','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1041,'Saksham','Verma',0,'7814931623','ipm24102@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2005-11-09',1,101,15,989,'','1,2,9',9,'','','','1745410306IPM24102_Saksham_Verma.pdf','','During my academic journey at IIM Jammu, I participated in a live project as a Stock Market Intern at FinPro Wealth, where I worked for four weeks conducting in-depth market research and advanced financial analysis.','If selected for an internship with CRY, I aim to combine my analytical skills and empathy to drive meaningful impact. Through my live project at FinPro Wealth, I’ve honed research and data analysis abilities that can support CRY’s program evaluation.','8','IIM Jammu Placement Cell',1,'4','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1042,'Mrunaalini','Sahas',0,'9103208987','ipm24074@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-08-08',2,101,15,989,'','1,5,10',9,'','','','1745410372IPM24074_Mrunaalini_Sahas.pdf','','I was a Stock Market Intern at FinPro Wealth from December 2024 to January 2025. I was a member of Arithmós, the Management and Strategy Fest of NM College. Now, I am a member of the Academic Committee, Product Management Club, and Debating Soc','If chosen for an internship with CRY, I aim to contribute with strong research, communication, and organization skills to support and initiate campaigns. I also aim to drive meaningful change by being creative, empathetic, and logical in situations.','8','College',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1043,'Tulip','Shaoo',0,'9007185571','tulipshaoo2005@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2005-08-02',2,101,36,2833,'','1,2,9',9,'','','','1745410566DOC-20240915-WA0030__(1).pdf','','Volunteer at Ektara NGO, Research Intern at Spriha Society','If chosen for internship i would, support CRY\'s mission to ensure children\'s rights to education, health, and protection. Apply my skills to conduct research, collect data, and analyze information.','5','',3,'4','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',2,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1044,'Kanupriya','Garg',0,'8383003028','IPM24060@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-05-03',2,101,15,989,'','1,3,9',9,'','','','1745410642Kanupriya_Garg_CV.pdf','','Volunteered as a Fundraiser at HelpAge India, supporting elderly care. Interned at FinPro Wealth, learned stock market basics, ratio analysis, and created a market analysis report. These roles grew my analytical and social impact interests.','I aim to bring analytical skills, research-driven insights, and passion for social equity to support CRY\'s initiatives. I’ll contribute by identifying and analyzing CSR trends, design impactful strategies, and amplifying data-backed advocacy efforts.','8','IPM Placement Committee, IIM Jammu',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1045,'Aryan','Mahla',0,'8233441305','IPM24021@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-10-04',1,101,15,989,'','1,7,11',9,'','','','1745410652IPM24021_Aryan_CV.pdf','','Volunteered twice with Saksham samajik uthaan avem vikas sansthan NGO (May–June 2022 & 2023), aiding in food distribution, mentoring underprivileged kids, awareness drives, and planning community development projects.','I aim to bring data-driven insights, creative communication, and a strong sense of responsibility to CRY, leveraging my research skills and leadership experience to support impactful initiatives that uplift underprivileged children.','8','Placement Committee of college',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1046,'Aditya','Pawar',0,'9424850815','ipm24006@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-06-29',1,101,12,765,'','1,3,10',9,'','','','1745410688IPM24006_Aditya_Pawar.pdf','','Successfully completed an online internship with Humari Pahechan NGO, during which I raised Rs. 7,000 through a crowd-funding initiative. Additionally, I organized and conducted an awareness campaign utilizing various social media platforms.','I bring qualities such as social media expertise for raising awareness, data analysis for informed decisions, and effective communication to foster trust with beneficiaries, making me a strong fit for this role.','8','Placement Committee',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1047,'Ayushi','Sahu',0,'8878498603','ipm24026@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2005-11-14',2,101,15,989,'','1,9,11',9,'','','','1745410753IPM24026_Ayushi_Sahu.pdf','','At AIESEC, I bridged global talent with Indian firms, managed 500+ profiles, and led Youth Speak Forum. At IIM Jammu, I mentor students, conduct prep sessions, and organise seminars for 200+ peers, building strong leadership and communication skills.','I want to contribute with empathy, purpose, and initiative – supporting CRY in areas like education, outreach, or research. I\'m eager to learn, grow, and be part of a team creating real impact at the grassroots level.','5','',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1048,'Vaanya','Dugar',0,'6350609055','ipm24127@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2005-10-18',2,101,15,989,'','1,5,9',9,'','','','1745410803IPM24127_Vaanya_Dugar.pdf','','I’ve organized art workshops for underprivileged girls at my school, teaching and engaging them creatively. I also volunteered during our school’s annual function and sports day, helping with event coordination and student participation.','I aim to bring creativity, planning skills, and a passion for child rights. I’ve led art workshops for underprivileged girls and volunteered at school events. I’ll contribute fresh ideas, assist in activities, and grow through hands-on learning at CR','8','College',1,'4','Dear, Vaanya Dugar,\n\nJammu&nbsp; ,Jammu &amp; Kashmir\n\nWe are happy to confirm your Online internship with CRY India with the Corporate Partneships&nbsp; team for a period of 4 weeks . The date of internship commencement will be 29 May 2025.\n\nYour internship will comprise of you working with us as an Operations Interns for an upcoming program along with any other work which might come in your way looking into your skill sets.\n\n\nAs an intern with CRY, you will be required to adhere to the rules and policies of the organisation. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:\n\n\n Respect for Human Dignity\n\n Transparency\n\n Innovation \n\n accountability \n\n Secularism\n\n Non Violence\n\n Working in Partnership\n\n During the internship you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.\n\nRegards\n\nSmriti Rustagi\nAssistant Manager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-04-23','2025-04-29',7,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-29'),(1049,'Anvitha','Gottumukkala',0,'6304110965','ipm24017@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-08-09',2,101,15,989,'','1,2,3',9,'','','','1745411014Anvitha_Gottumukkala_CV.pdf','','My volunteering experience is what I had in school and college, which includes clean-ups of the beach and the environment, different awareness walks, and participating in campaigns for hygiene and other facilities.','I will be grateful for this opportunity to use my skills and academic background to contribute to society in any way I can. My willingness to be consistent, determined, and to learn will add value to the organisation. ','8','College Placement Committee',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1050,'Jigar','Godhaniya',0,'8200613349','ipm24047@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2005-09-28',1,101,15,989,'','1',9,'','','','1745411224IPM24047_JigarGodhaniya_2.pdf','','Helped set up a learning centre for underprivileged children in slums. Spoke to kids to identify educational gaps, which guided resource planning and curriculum design to better meet their learning needs.','Would support CRY by ideating and implementing a structured internship program that engages youth in child rights advocacy, ensuring meaningful roles, skill development, and measurable impact for both interns and the organization.','8','College',1,'12','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12');
