to the rules and policies of the organisation. You are also expected to uphold the CRY values listed below:\n\n\n Respect for Human Dignity\n\n Transparency\n\n Innovation \n\n accountability \n\n Secularism\n\n Non Violence\n\n Working in Partnership\n\n During the internship you will be required to work according to a timetable evolved by you and your mentor and. Inability to abide by set timelines and task requirements need to be communicated clearly to the person supervising your internship.\n\nWe welcome you on-board the CRY Intern team and look forward to a sustained and productive partnership with you.\n\nRegards\n\nSmriti Rustagi\nAssistant Manager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','This is to certify that Mishika Khanna, student of Indian Institute Of Management–Jammu has interned with CRY - Child Rights and You from Jun 5th 2025 to Jul 3rd 2025. During her internship tenure, she worked with the Volunteer Engagement. She was primarily involved as a Research and documentation, hiring interns , Data Analysis intern and We found Mishika Khanna to be hard-working and good at her work. We wish her all the very best in her future endeavours.','2025-07-22','2025-08-06',8,'2025-08-06',1,'certificate/803300424.pdf','2025-06-05'),(1053,'Anvitha','Amarthaluri',0,'8639624775','ipm24009@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-07-30',2,101,15,989,'','1,2,3',9,'','','','1745411373IPM24009_Anvitha_Amarthaluri.pdf','','I haven\'t done any volunteering of such but I actively engage in social initiatives through Kartavya, The Social Responsibility Club at IIM Jammu.\r\nParticipated in Swachhata Hi Sewa, Cleanliness Drive on Campus.','I hope to bring fresh perspectives. As a member of Kartavya, The Social Responsibility Club at IIM Jammu make a meaningful impact by spreading awareness about child rights. I want to contribute to the society in any way i can.','8','College Placement Committee',1,'8','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1054,'Antarpreet ','Kaur',0,'9103815060','ipm24016@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2006-06-06',2,101,15,989,'','1,2,3',9,'','','','1745411441IPM24016_Antarpreet_Kaur.pdf','','I volunteered in a blind school during my 12th class as part of a school initiative. We organized some enjoyable activities and games for the children. The aim was to foster interaction between them and students from our school.','This internship will allow me to learn campaign management skills such as strategy, reporting, communication, and collaboration. Additionally, I believe that it will help me develop emotional intelligence and networking skills','8','College',1,'12','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',3,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1056,'Divyansh','Kapoor',0,'9317547498','ipm24040@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'2005-11-10',1,101,15,989,'','2,4,8',9,'','','','1745411655IPM24040_Divyansh_Kapoor.pdf','','None','If chosen for an internship with CRY, I aim to add value through strong research and analytical skills, creative communication for outreach, and a fresh youth perspective to support impactful campaigns and programs.','8','',1,'4','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',0,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1057,'Pratima','Yadav',0,'8007038187','yadavpratima129@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2001-09-13',2,101,21,1793,'','1,2,5,6',10,'','','','1745412370Pratima_Yadav__Resume.pdf','','Currently working as a Teach For India Fellow. I have also worked with Civis as public health campaign associate and Udayan Care as Program coordinator.','I aim to contribute my classroom experience, contextual content design skills, and grassroots understanding of children’s challenges to support CRY’s mission. I bring empathy, adaptability, and a strong commitment to equity and child rights.','1','',1,'4','','','2025-04-23','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-05-12'),(1058,'Shreya','Upadhyay',0,'6398341774','ipm24112@iimj.ac.in','','','',0,0,'