ds\n\nShreeya Dutta\nManager\n\n\nPLEASE DO NOT WRITE OR CALL IN THE DETAILS GIVEN IN THE FOOTER. AT THE RIGHT TIME, YOU WILL BE INFORMED ON HOW TO RESPOND BACK','','2025-07-31','2025-10-06',6,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,'2025-10-07'),(2549,'Toya','Sen',0,'8451807169','toyasen1606@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2004-06-16',2,101,21,1793,'','1,3,4',9,'','','','1753954094Toya_Sen_(CV).pdf','','My previous internship at Legal Upanishad (a legal blog website) taught me how to research and simplify complex legal topics for a wider audience. This helped me improve my writing and communication skills.','If chosen for an internship with CRY, I aim to contribute by applying my research and designing skills to support child rights initiatives by making complex legal concepts easier for children to understand. ','4','',3,'4','','','2025-07-31','0000-00-00',2,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,NULL),(2550,'Donam ','Parihar ',0,'7456803165','donamstudyhub@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2003-09-15',2,101,34,2571,'','11',10,'','','','1753957495CV-_Donam_Parihar.pdf','','I managed many volunteering event.','','5','',1,'4','','','2025-07-31','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,NULL),(2551,'Mohd Abdul Quadir','Siddiqui',0,'8433299714','abdulqadirsiddiqui777@gmail.com','','','',0,0,'2002-04-19',1,101,34,2597,'','2,5,9,10,11',11,'pursuiung US CMA (Certified Management Accountant) from IMA','','','1753969979Mohd_Abdul_Quadir_resume_for_cry_volunteering.pdf','','i had an great experience in my prviouse cry volunteering i had accomplished plenty of profound task and every task aims to mitigate and combate the problem of child labour in our society  i had spread awareness in many public places in my city and ','i posses great skills of cordination and motivation to accomplish a group task plus i also have great leadership which are build through my journey of being a cabinet mamber as discipline incharge of my school an active member in college clubs','1','',1,'8','','','2025-07-31','0000-00-00',1,'0000-00-00',0,NULL,NULL),(