ventions&nbsp;</div>','2025-05-14','2025-06-13',10,NULL,'1',1,0,'2025-05-14 05:24:00','2025-05-14','',1),(10,4,0,3,2,'Closely working for Online internship of under 18 ','','<div>Online Internship Program of Under 18&nbsp;</div>','2025-05-14','2025-07-14',10,NULL,'5',4,0,'2025-05-14 05:26:12','2025-05-14','',1),(11,1,0,2,2,'Documenting CSH and FSH document for East','','<div>Documenting CSH and FSH document for East</div>','2025-05-16','2025-05-31',36,NULL,'1',40,0,'2025-05-16 05:27:50','2025-05-16','',1),(12,1,0,2,2,'Cyber Smart Heroes -Documentation.','','<div>Cyber Smart Heroes Doumentation.</div>','2025-05-19','2025-05-31',36,NULL,'1',40,0,'2025-05-19 06:30:35','2025-05-19','',1),(13,1,0,2,2,'Content Writing- Case Story Documentation','','<div>Content Writing- Case Story Documentation</div>','2025-05-19','2025-05-31',0,NULL,'11',40,0,'2025-05-19 06:49:34','2025-05-19','',1),(14,1,0,2,2,'Case Story Documentation','','<div>Case Story Documentation</div>','2025-05-19','2025-05-31',0,NULL,'11',40,0,'2025-05-19 09:33:38','2025-05-19','',1),(15,1,0,2,2,'Analysis of Intern and Volunteer Database','','<div>Analysis of Intern and Volunteer Database for more insights</div>','2025-05-19','2025-05-31',0,NULL,'9',3,0,'2025-05-19 11:00:22','2025-05-19','',1),(16,1,0,2,2,'Preparing PPT on CSP of CRY','','<div>Prepare a detailed presentation on CRY\'s Child Safeguarding policy groupwise</div>','2025-05-20','2025-05-22',0,NULL,'3',130,0,'2025-05-20 05:53:42','2025-05-20','',1),(17,1,0,3,2,'Capturing Intern bytes','','<div>Capturing Intern bytes</div>','2025-05-20','2025-05-25',0,NULL,'4',4,0,'2025-05-20 06:40:31','2025-05-20','',1),(18,1,0,3,2,'Designing poster based on CRY\'s designing/ branding guideline','','<div>Designing poster based on CRY\'s designing/ branding guideline</div><div>1. Education</div><div>2. Protection</div><div>3. Health and Nutrition</div>','2025-05-20','2025-05-23',0,NULL,'3',3,0,'2025-05-20 07:00:22','2025-05-20','',1),(19,4,0,3,2,'Media Work And Research ','','They will rigrously working on Media stories and research work&nbsp;','2025-05-20','2025-06-27',10,NULL,'4',7,0,'2025-05-20 09:32:44','2025-05-20','',1),(20,4,0,2,2,'Onground Work in Ghaziabad ','','<div>Interaction with Children&nbsp;</div>','2025-05-20','2025-07-20',10,NULL,'2',2,0,'2025-05-20 09:40:58','2025-05-20','',1),(21,4,0,3,2,'Primray Research and Documentation ','','<div>Maintaining&nbsp; Internship Date&nbsp;</div>','2025-05-20','2025-06-20',10,NULL,'1',2,0,'2025-05-20 09:47:22','2025-05-20','',1),(22,4,0,3,2,'Working CLosely for WMD Project','','<div>Initiating A Campaign&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>World Music Daty ideation and planning the campaign&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;</div>','2025-05-20','2025-07-20',10,NULL,'5',4,0,'2025-05-20 09:52:44','2025-05-20','',1),(23,1,0,2,2,'Content Writing: Case Story Documentation','','<div>Content Writing: Case Story Documentation</div>','2025-05-20','2025-05-31',0,NULL,'11',15,0,'2025-05-20 09:53:26','2025-05-20','',1),(24,1,0,2,2,'Project Work: PAG Documentation','','<div>PUBLIC ACTION GROUPS (PAGs) – IMPACT STUDY DOCUMENT</div><div>1. Introduction</div><div>Public Action Groups (PAGs) are grassroots volunteer-led education initiatives implemented</div><div>under the Volunteer Engagement department. These groups operate in underprivileged</div><div>communities and aim to provide free, supplementary educational support to children through</div><div>weekly sessions. In addition to academic help, volunteers also engage children in life skills</div><div>activities and celebrate special days to promote holistic development. The model is driven by</div><div>committed volunteers and supervised by project managers to ensure structure and</div><div>consistency.</div><div>2. Objectives of the Impact Study</div><div>The purpose of this impact study is to:</div><div>? Understand the impact generated by PAGs on children’s academic and life skills</div><div>development.</div><div>? Document the interventions carried out (academic sessions, life skills training,</div><div>celebrations, etc.).</div><div>? Reflect on the efficacy of the volunteer-driven model.</div><div>? Capture volunteers’ experience, challenges, and areas for support.</div><div>? Identify areas for improvement to enhance the quality and sustainability of PAGs.</div><div>3. Stakeholders Involved</div><div>? Volunteers: Primary implementers and key informants.</div><div>? Children: Direct beneficiaries of the program.</div><div>? Community members (if needed in a later phase).</div><div>? Interns: Will conduct the study, interact with stakeholders, document findings, and</div><div>submit an analysis.</div><div>4. Role of Interns in the Study</div><div>Interns will be responsible for:</div><div>? Visiting selected PAG sites during ongoing sessions.</div><div>? Interacting with volunteers and children.</div><div>? Administering questionnaires and conducting informal interviews/focus group</div><div>discussions (FGDs).</div><div>? Documenting case studies or success stories.</div><div>? Compiling all data and preparing a final report (quantitative + qualitative insights).</div><div>? Suggesting recommendations based on field observations.</div>','2025-05-22','2025-05-31',0,NULL,'1',27,0,'2025-05-22 05:24:32','2025-05-22','',1),(25,4,0,1,2,'YCC Under 18 ','','<div>Holding the YCC Internship program&nbsp;</div>','2025-05-22','2025-06-30',0,NULL,'5',3,0,'2025-05-22 10:25:14','2025-05-22','',1),(26,1,0,2,2,'Project: Mapping the effect of gender in the everyday spatial experiences of adolescent children','','<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us;mso-bidi-font-weight:=\"\" bold\"=\"\">CRY x DCOOP X Why Loiter<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Project:\r\nMapping the effect of gender in the everyday spatial experiences of adolescent\r\nchildren</span></b></div>\r\n\r\n<div><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b></div>\r\n\r\n<div><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">WEEK 1<o:p></o:p></span></b></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Given below is an\r\noutline of the methodology for data collection. The activities listed are the\r\nminimum that you are required to do. Additionally, if you find directions which\r\ncan lead you to more information, please pursue them. These can often arise\r\nduring interviews so keep the subjective questions as open-ended as possible.<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Suggested sequence:<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:verdana;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-us\"=\"\">a)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Note\r\nessential details of the child as given in the <b>Google Form</b> (first few\r\nquestions) <o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Name\r\n(only first name and first letter of surname – e.g. Shilpa R)<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Age<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Class\r\nin school<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Siblings<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Father’s\r\nprofession<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Mother’s\r\nprofession<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:verdana;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-us\"=\"\">b)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Have\r\na <b>group discussion</b> around the subjective questions (separate groups for\r\nboys &amp; girls)<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:verdana;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-us\"=\"\">c)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Find\r\nan appropriate map in which you can mark the location of the school, the\r\nchild’s home, routes taken to commute to school, places of leisure etc. Make a\r\ncopy of the map for each child.<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:verdana;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-us\"=\"\">d)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Ask\r\nthem to describe their typical routine on a school day (you can draw this on\r\nthe map or make detailed notes)<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:verdana;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-us\"=\"\">e)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">MENTAL\r\nMAP</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">: Ask them to draw a\r\nmap of such a day – they can show their home, school, routes to school, places\r\nof leisure, places of interest/ importance, landmarks etc. <o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">NOTE:\r\nThis is a <u>mental map</u> and our intent is to understand what <i>they</i>\r\nthink is important so you should not give the reference of a ‘accurate’ map.<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:verdana;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-us\"=\"\">f)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Through\r\ninterviews and using the rest of the <b>Google form</b>, get a more detailed\r\nunderstanding of the children’s leisure activities and their commute to school –\r\nwhen, where, how, time, cost, company, affective responses (feelings and\r\nemotions) etc.<o:p></o:p></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:verdana;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-us\"=\"\">g)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:\" verdana\",sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:en-us\"=\"\">Document\r\nthe places they mention through <b>photographs</b>. Ideally if you can get them\r\nto accompany you and take the photographs themselves that will be great.<o:p></o:p></span></div>','2025-05-23','2025-06-04',36,NULL,'2,9',25,0,'2025-05-23 05:37:10','2025-05-23','',1),(27,2,0,3,2,'YCC prework','','<div>as discussed in the call</div>','2025-05-29','2025-05-31',17,NULL,'1',1,0,'2025-05-29 05:45:48','2025-05-29','',1),(28,2,0,3,2,'Summer camp planning and implemnetation','','<div>As dicussed over call</div>','2025-05-29','2025-06-30',0,NULL,'1,2',10,0,'2025-05-29 05:53:01','2025-05-29','',1),(29,4,0,3,2,'Working with finance ','','To work with Finance on systems and processes and admin work&nbsp;','2025-05-29','2025-06-30',10,NULL,'1,10',1,0,'2025-05-29 09:09:59','2025-05-29','',1),(30,2,0,3,2,'Research- May Interns ','','<div>As discussed over call</div>','2025-05-29','2025-05-31',17,NULL,'1',10,0,'2025-06-03 10:03:19','2025-05-29','',1),(31,2,0,1,2,'Direct intervention with children- PAGs','','<div>As discussed in the call</div>','2025-06-02','2025-06-30',0,NULL,'2',10,0,'2025-05-29 11:41:24','2025-05-29','',1),(32,2,0,1,2,'Data Analysis- DSHO','','<div>Data cleaning, sorting, visualization and analysis</div>','2025-06-02','2025-06-30',17,NULL,'9',10,0,'2025-06-03 10:24:38','2025-05-29','',1),(3