take place only for 15 minutes. If you are not ok with the date and time please let me know other date & time.\n\nKindly confirm.\n'),(49,33,1,'Video Call','2025-03-26 10:45:00','',0,'','','2025-03-19 15:06:11',43,'0000-00-00 00:00:00',0,0,' Hi, Your interview is scheduled for 26th March at 10:45 am. The interview will take place only for 15 minutes. If you are not ok with the date and time please let me know other date & time.\n\nKindly confirm.\n'),(50,26,1,'Video Call','2025-03-26 11:00:00','',0,'','','2025-03-19 15:07:49',43,'0000-00-00 00:00:00',0,0,' Hi, Your interview is scheduled for 26th March at 11 am. The interview will take place only for 15 minutes. If you are not ok with the date and time please let me know other date & time.\n\nKindly confirm.\n'),(51,25,1,'Video Call','2025-03-26 11:15:00','',3,'Hello,\n\nWe hope this email finds you well. We regret to inform you that, due to unforeseen circumstances, we are unable to offer you an internship opportunity with us at this time. However, I wanted to express my appreciation for your enthusiasm and interest in working with CRY (Child Rights and You).\n\nAlthough we couldn\'t accommodate you as an intern, we would be delighted to have you as a volunteer and provide you with an opportunity to support our cause. Your contribution as a volunteer can make a significant difference in the lives of underprivileged children.\n\nIf you are interested in joining us as a volunteer, please let me know, and I will be more than happy to plan an orientation session specifically for you. We value your commitment and look forward to having you on board.\n\nThank you once again for your understanding and willingness to support CRY. Please feel free to reach out to me if you have any questions or require further information on volunteering.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nManoj','3-1','2025-03-19 15:10:22',43,'0000-00-00 00:00:00',0,0,' Hi, Your interview is scheduled for 26th March at 11.15 AM. The interview will take place only for 15 